00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.948
Happy Move In Day!

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.916
[luggage wheels rolling]

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:19.786
Thank you!

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.368
(student #1)
Being able to really spend

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.238
