The energy is really great.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:47.347 align:start position:0%
(student #3)
Everything is a little
smaller than I remember!

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.149 align:end position:100%
Really?
[laughs]

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.254
(student #4)
Over at the library walk

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.289
over there, we have
free ice pops too!

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.124
So, feel free to stop by
them too.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.893 align:start size:50% position:50%
(other students)
Okay. Thank you!

